WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:10.520
Have you ever heard about that

00:10.520 --> 00:13.900
the cliff of a snow mountain

00:13.920 --> 00:19.590
once fascinated numerous people?

00:20.720 --> 00:23.960
Legend has it that,

00:23.960 --> 00:27.310
there were treasures at the peak

00:27.600 --> 00:33.230
but also there was a bottomless chasm hidden over there.

00:34.280 --> 00:37.740
The smart, the fool

00:37.760 --> 00:41.110
and the kind people,

00:41.200 --> 00:47.590
all are familiar to you.

00:47.920 --> 00:51.780
On the mountainside, on the cliff,

00:51.800 --> 00:54.780
on the cloud,

00:54.800 --> 01:00.470
and in the human world,

01:11.760 --> 01:19.590
snowflakes are drifting profusely and disorderly.

01:30.800 --> 01:34.800
Joy of Life Season 1

01:34.800 --> 01:38.270
Episode 45

02:09.900 --> 02:10.680
She's in the imperial palace.

02:10.700 --> 02:11.680
Who?

02:11.700 --> 02:12.760
Si Lili.

02:12.780 --> 02:14.040
How dare you mention her?

02:14.060 --> 02:15.470
I'm about to settle the score with you.

02:15.490 --> 02:16.730
I'm the envoy of Nanqing,

02:16.730 --> 02:17.880
and she belongs to His...

02:17.900 --> 02:18.980
She likes you.

02:18.980 --> 02:19.980
I have to help her.

02:19.980 --> 02:21.600
His Majesty is your little nephew.

02:21.620 --> 02:23.190
But Lili is my sister.

02:23.210 --> 02:24.730
What a messy relationship!

02:27.340 --> 02:29.160
She just wanted to talk to you before
going into the imperial palace.

02:29.180 --> 02:30.260
She didn't ask you to marry her.

02:30.260 --> 02:31.920
Why do you panic?

02:36.980 --> 02:38.450
How's she now?

02:38.850 --> 02:39.760
She's learning etiquette

02:39.780 --> 02:41.680
and getting ready to meet His Majesty
in the imperial palace at any time.

02:41.700 --> 02:42.550
I'm afraid

02:42.570 --> 02:43.900
you won't be able to see her again.

02:43.900 --> 02:45.330
I don't want to see her.

02:46.980 --> 02:48.010
To you,

02:48.010 --> 02:49.040
it was

02:49.060 --> 02:50.480
just a talk.

02:50.620 --> 02:52.170
But to Lili,

02:53.060 --> 02:54.700
she drifted along all her life

02:54.700 --> 02:56.190
struggling for survival.

02:56.210 --> 02:57.600
A talk with you

02:57.620 --> 02:58.490
might be one of

02:58.490 --> 03:00.560
her few good memories.

03:01.010 --> 03:02.910
If you still feel angry,

03:02.930 --> 03:05.450
don't blame her but me.

03:20.780 --> 03:25.010
Your Majesty, happy birthday! May
you live as long as the Heaven!

03:25.010 --> 03:27.610
May you live a thousand of years!

03:28.570 --> 03:29.990
Thank you for your

03:30.010 --> 03:31.920
best wishes.

03:32.370 --> 03:34.000
Please!

03:41.540 --> 03:44.640
Take your seats.

03:44.700 --> 03:47.400
Thank you, Your Majesty.

03:51.570 --> 03:53.400
Let's eat!

04:08.450 --> 04:10.760
Your Majesty the Empress Dowager! Your Majesty the Emperor!

04:10.780 --> 04:12.240
I'm Langtao.

04:12.260 --> 04:14.630
I'd like to compete

04:14.650 --> 04:15.960
with His Excellency Fan from Nanqing,

04:15.980 --> 04:18.410
so as to add fun to the birthday celebration.

04:20.140 --> 04:23.480
Mr. Fan, do you want to compete with him?

04:24.050 --> 04:25.410
Your Majesty,

04:25.650 --> 04:27.520
I'm willing to

04:27.540 --> 04:28.630
admit defeat.

04:28.650 --> 04:31.410
No need to compete.

04:31.700 --> 04:33.370
Then,

04:33.490 --> 04:35.480
so be it.

04:38.700 --> 04:40.040
Your Excellency,

04:40.740 --> 04:43.000
are you admitting that Nanqing is weak

04:43.020 --> 04:44.440
without competent martial arts masters?

04:44.460 --> 04:46.120
I admit defeat for myself.

04:46.140 --> 04:47.470
It has nothing to do with Nanqing.

04:47.490 --> 04:49.120
Didn't you remain undefeated

04:49.140 --> 04:51.320
in front of your residence?

04:51.980 --> 04:53.020
After entering Shangjing,

04:53.020 --> 04:55.090
didn't you keep the flag unharmed on
your way to the imperial palace?

04:56.020 --> 04:57.920
How come you chicken out

04:58.140 --> 05:00.160
in front of me?

05:02.980 --> 05:05.440
Is it because the Nanqing martial arts masters

05:05.650 --> 05:08.010
all tend to bully the weak and fear the strong?

05:13.820 --> 05:15.280
I won't force you.

05:15.300 --> 05:16.370
As long as you admit that

05:16.370 --> 05:19.570
martial arts masters from Nanqing are weak and coward,

05:20.300 --> 05:24.480
I can let you off.

05:38.170 --> 05:39.600
Then let's fight.

05:39.820 --> 05:41.600
I have something to say.

05:50.300 --> 05:52.310
Senior, let me fight him instead.

05:52.330 --> 05:53.280
Why?

05:53.300 --> 05:55.030
I'm the Saintess of Beiqi,

05:55.050 --> 05:56.000
but he talked wildly,

05:56.020 --> 05:58.170
on the Hall, saying that

05:58.170 --> 06:00.070
he fell in love with me at first sight.

06:00.090 --> 06:01.090
He must be good

06:01.090 --> 06:02.680
at martial arts.

06:02.700 --> 06:04.150
Today, I want to see

06:04.170 --> 06:05.400
how deeply

06:05.420 --> 06:07.760
he loves me.

06:09.700 --> 06:11.570
Your Majesty, I beg your approval.

06:11.650 --> 06:14.880
Langtao, back off.

06:26.170 --> 06:27.400
Will you fight me?

06:27.420 --> 06:29.680
Of course. Why not?

06:29.700 --> 06:31.370
What weapon will you use?

06:31.860 --> 06:33.130
Sword.

06:33.980 --> 06:35.460
His Excellency once fought a Ninth Dan martial arts master,

06:35.460 --> 06:37.020
and he's also the poetic genius sent from Heaven.

06:37.020 --> 06:38.650
Haitang is the Saintess of Beiqi

06:38.650 --> 06:40.570
and the youngest martial arts master above the Ninth Dan.

06:40.770 --> 06:42.140
Among the younger generation,

06:42.140 --> 06:43.490
the most famous two

06:43.490 --> 06:45.570
are finally competing for victory!

06:49.140 --> 06:50.070
Wang,

06:50.090 --> 06:52.040
why aren't you excited?

06:52.860 --> 06:54.440
This fight

06:55.460 --> 06:57.040
won't be exciting to watch.

06:58.580 --> 07:00.480
How do you know?

07:00.540 --> 07:01.880
Just wait and see.

08:13.260 --> 08:15.690
Why don't they fight seriously?

08:15.820 --> 08:16.910
Just think about it.

08:16.930 --> 08:18.410
Come closer! Come closer! Come closer!

08:18.890 --> 08:20.480
What's the relationship

08:20.610 --> 08:22.630
between Miss Duoduo

08:22.650 --> 08:24.480
and His Excellency?

08:25.330 --> 08:26.720
It's...

08:27.090 --> 08:28.310
What is it?

08:28.330 --> 08:30.870
They're intimate.

08:30.890 --> 08:32.920
How can they fight each other seriously?

08:35.700 --> 08:37.920
But Miss Duoduo is not to blame.

08:38.100 --> 08:39.470
Look at His Excellency.

08:39.490 --> 08:41.080
He's adept with both the pen and the sword.

08:41.170 --> 08:43.600
How can any girl not like him?

08:44.370 --> 08:46.470
I just feel sorry for Beiqi.

08:46.490 --> 08:48.330
They've only cultivated

08:48.490 --> 08:50.080
one Saintess for so many years,

08:50.100 --> 08:50.780
but she falls for

08:50.780 --> 08:52.770
His Excellency.

11:03.580 --> 11:05.200
Are you fighting

11:05.220 --> 11:06.880
or dancing?

11:06.900 --> 11:08.600
It's Her Majesty's birthday.

11:08.660 --> 11:10.680
What are you doing?

11:10.700 --> 11:12.810
Are you cheating Her Majesty?

11:42.220 --> 11:43.970
Saintess, your martial arts skills are really amazing.

11:43.970 --> 11:45.280
I really admire you.

11:46.140 --> 11:47.590
Your Excellency, you're really resourceful.

11:47.610 --> 11:48.850
I fail to control my strength

11:48.850 --> 11:50.100
when fighting with a real competitor.

11:50.100 --> 11:51.760
I didn't mean to hurt this minister.

11:51.780 --> 11:53.080
I'm really sorry.

12:04.660 --> 12:05.640
Your Majesty,

12:05.660 --> 12:07.830
our fight ends in a tie.

12:07.850 --> 12:09.320
Good! Good! Good!

12:09.340 --> 12:10.880
On such an auspicious day,

12:10.900 --> 12:13.920
a tie is the best.

12:14.260 --> 12:17.510
That fight was really beautiful.

12:17.530 --> 12:18.800
So auspicious!

12:18.820 --> 12:21.960
I like it.

12:22.820 --> 12:24.720
When we see the princess back home,

12:25.020 --> 12:26.590
we must say

12:26.610 --> 12:28.370
they fought each other relentlessly

12:28.370 --> 12:29.960
with blood all over their faces.

12:31.850 --> 12:32.760
Why?

12:32.780 --> 12:34.030
Otherwise, I'm afraid it might be hard

12:34.050 --> 12:36.480
for His Excellency to explain.

12:37.700 --> 12:39.650
Thank you, Your Majesty.

12:45.140 --> 12:47.520
Right! Right!

12:47.970 --> 12:49.000
Wang,

12:49.020 --> 12:51.400
you're really foresighted!

12:51.900 --> 12:53.370
I really admire you.

12:53.700 --> 12:55.610
Wang, I've learned a lot

12:55.610 --> 12:57.770
by your side these days.

12:57.900 --> 12:58.800
Wang,

12:58.820 --> 12:59.700
I even feel

12:59.700 --> 13:00.800
I've become much cleverer

13:00.820 --> 13:02.400
these days.

13:02.660 --> 13:06.160
But you must know how far to go and when to stop.

13:06.530 --> 13:07.470
you can't

13:07.490 --> 13:09.880
outsmart His Excellency.

13:09.900 --> 13:11.770
I know that.

13:12.140 --> 13:13.320
Wang,

13:13.340 --> 13:15.810
let's restrain our talents.

13:18.700 --> 13:20.030
Fan Xian,

13:20.050 --> 13:22.660
I heard after going back to Nanqing,

13:22.660 --> 13:25.960
you'll take over the financial power of Neiku.

13:26.220 --> 13:27.440
After that,

13:27.460 --> 13:30.590
Embroidered Uniform Guards

13:30.610 --> 13:34.160
will do business with your branch on behalf of Beiqi.

13:34.340 --> 13:35.710
I see.

13:35.730 --> 13:37.450
Wait!

13:45.170 --> 13:46.470
Your Majesty,

13:46.490 --> 13:48.640
I find it inappropriate.

13:48.660 --> 13:50.590
We'd better consider carefully before making the decision.

13:50.610 --> 13:52.080
Commander Shen,

13:52.100 --> 13:52.930
I've thought it

13:52.930 --> 13:55.200
through.

13:55.220 --> 13:58.030
It can only benefit Beiqi.

13:58.050 --> 13:59.710
Nothing is inappropriate.

13:59.730 --> 14:02.100
Fan Xian is too cunning to trust.

14:02.100 --> 14:04.770
Your Majesty, please think twice.

14:10.970 --> 14:12.200
Your Majesty,

14:12.220 --> 14:14.760
I have something to report.

14:14.780 --> 14:17.370
I originally intended to hold it after the birthday celebration,

14:17.660 --> 14:20.100
but since Shen Zhong is too arrogant,

14:20.100 --> 14:22.960
I can't tolerate it anymore.

14:23.660 --> 14:25.950
Tell me about it.

14:25.970 --> 14:27.490
Shen Zhong, Commander-in-chief of

14:27.490 --> 14:29.000
Embroidered Uniform Guards,

14:29.020 --> 14:30.780
is suspected of colluding with the Investigator's Office

14:30.780 --> 14:32.030
to sell military information.

14:32.050 --> 14:34.340
Treacherous as he is, he should be punished.

14:34.340 --> 14:36.890
Your Majesty, please be perceptive and perspicacious.

14:37.700 --> 14:40.650
Having controlled Embroidered Uniform Guards for so many years,

14:40.780 --> 14:43.910
Shen Zhong is loyal to Beiqi all the time.

14:43.930 --> 14:46.280
By accusing him of treason,

14:46.700 --> 14:48.800
you'd better not talk recklessly.

14:48.820 --> 14:50.120
I have evidence.

14:50.140 --> 14:51.770
What evidence?

14:52.490 --> 14:54.330
Our war against Nanqing

14:54.580 --> 14:55.910
was started by mistake,

14:55.930 --> 14:57.960
but we suffered great losses.

14:58.610 --> 15:02.080
After all, we lost because

15:02.140 --> 15:04.400
our military information was leaked.

15:04.460 --> 15:07.220
Yan Bingyun from the Investigator's Office
pried into information in Shangjing

15:07.220 --> 15:09.010
and leaked the military information.

15:09.900 --> 15:11.270
Everyone here

15:11.290 --> 15:13.370
must have known about this.

15:16.170 --> 15:18.130
But what you don't know is that

15:18.220 --> 15:19.850
after coming to Shangjing,

15:19.850 --> 15:22.610
Yan Bingyun and Lady Shen fell in love

15:22.610 --> 15:24.080
and often saw each other in private.

15:24.100 --> 15:26.080
It's pretty obvious as to

15:26.410 --> 15:28.000
who leaked the military information.

15:28.020 --> 15:29.470
Nonsense!

15:29.490 --> 15:31.410
Yan Bingyun and Lady Shen

15:31.410 --> 15:32.470
were intimate with each other.

15:32.490 --> 15:34.710
Many people can prove that.

15:34.730 --> 15:36.590
What's more,

15:36.610 --> 15:38.830
when Yan Bingyun was caught,

15:38.850 --> 15:42.470
Lady Shen visited him many times.

15:42.490 --> 15:45.120
Their love was true.

15:45.140 --> 15:46.140
Additionally, when Fan Xian

15:46.140 --> 15:47.610
tried to rescue Yan Bingyun,

15:47.610 --> 15:48.820
Lady Shen was the one

15:48.820 --> 15:50.030
who led the way.

15:50.050 --> 15:52.470
Many officers from Embroidered Uniform Guards saw that.

15:52.490 --> 15:54.350
Your Excellency Shen,

15:54.370 --> 15:55.880
do you still want to deny it?

15:55.900 --> 15:58.520
She was deceived by Yan Bingyun.

16:01.820 --> 16:02.730
Your Majesty,

16:02.730 --> 16:04.610
I've never told my family

16:04.610 --> 16:05.830
about military information.

16:05.850 --> 16:07.580
Yan Bingyun couldn't have

16:07.580 --> 16:09.770
got information from her.

16:10.260 --> 16:11.960
Having told her or not,

16:12.730 --> 16:15.370
you know it better than me.

16:20.490 --> 16:21.510
Your Majesty,

16:21.530 --> 16:23.830
my loyalty to Beiqi

16:23.850 --> 16:25.390
is without question.

16:25.410 --> 16:26.700
The frontier forces were defeated repeatedly,

16:26.700 --> 16:27.610
and His Excellency Shen,

16:27.610 --> 16:29.920
knew the military deployment very well.

16:29.970 --> 16:31.590
Your Excellency,

16:31.610 --> 16:33.910
your sister and you

16:33.930 --> 16:36.010
are really suspicious.

16:36.290 --> 16:39.150
Your Majesty, though I'm not capable,

16:39.170 --> 16:40.100
I know

16:40.100 --> 16:41.660
I'm a citizen of Beiqi.

16:41.660 --> 16:44.480
I would never betray my country.

16:48.290 --> 16:50.880
I know

16:50.900 --> 16:52.470
Shen Zhong is loyal.

16:52.490 --> 16:55.330
His Excellency Shen may be loyal,

16:56.170 --> 16:58.040
but his sister...

16:58.340 --> 16:59.510
I suggest

16:59.530 --> 17:01.530
sending Lady Shen to prison

17:01.530 --> 17:04.600
and using cruel torture to find out the truth.

17:04.650 --> 17:05.500
Your Majesty,

17:05.500 --> 17:06.340
though my sister

17:06.340 --> 17:08.390
was blinded by love,

17:08.410 --> 17:09.480
she would never

17:09.500 --> 17:11.480
betray our country.

17:11.500 --> 17:13.600
Your Majesty, please be perceptive and perspicacious.

17:21.010 --> 17:23.050
Your Majesty, what do you think?

17:24.580 --> 17:26.720
Mother, it's up to you.

17:29.100 --> 17:32.680
Loyal and brave all the time,

17:32.820 --> 17:35.890
Commander Shen has rendered many meritorious services to Beiqi.

17:35.930 --> 17:37.930
It's inappropriate

17:37.930 --> 17:40.050
to humiliate a meritorious minister.

17:40.100 --> 17:42.200
But there's something

17:43.050 --> 17:45.440
suspicious about it.

17:45.460 --> 17:46.980
Even if your sister

17:46.980 --> 17:48.720
didn't leak the secrets,

17:48.740 --> 17:51.860
Shen Zhong, you're to blame for not teaching her

17:51.860 --> 17:53.250
properly.

17:54.530 --> 17:57.720
You can still be the Commander-in-Chief,

17:57.740 --> 18:00.960
but the python pattern on your robe

18:03.380 --> 18:05.890
should be removed.

18:08.860 --> 18:10.800
Her Majesty has given the order.

18:11.130 --> 18:13.410
What're you waiting for?

18:41.250 --> 18:42.740
You killed my personal guards

18:42.740 --> 18:44.720
and my adoptive father.

18:44.980 --> 18:47.250
Have you ever thought this would happen to you?

18:51.980 --> 18:53.720
Fan Xian.

18:56.100 --> 18:57.250
Yes.

18:57.250 --> 18:58.930
The business between Neiku

18:58.930 --> 19:00.840
and Embroidered Uniform Guards

19:00.860 --> 19:02.840
is settled.

19:03.100 --> 19:05.230
After returning to Nanqing,

19:05.250 --> 19:08.390
you should arrange it as soon as possible.

19:08.410 --> 19:09.770
I see.

19:09.770 --> 19:11.170
Your Majesty.

19:12.860 --> 19:16.870
I still find it inappropriate.

19:16.890 --> 19:20.440
Commander Shen is excited and indignant.

19:20.460 --> 19:22.270
It's not appropriate for him to discuss government affairs.

19:22.290 --> 19:24.220
Send him back

19:24.220 --> 19:26.410
for a few days' rest.

19:29.650 --> 19:30.960
Your Majesty,

19:31.010 --> 19:32.650
whatever I say,

19:32.650 --> 19:34.270
I say it for the benefits of Beiqi.

19:34.290 --> 19:36.680
I'm selfless, Your Majesty!

19:37.740 --> 19:39.530
You're selfless.

19:40.580 --> 19:43.720
Are you suggesting we are selfish?

19:44.890 --> 19:46.820
Her Majesty decides to do business with Neiku.

19:46.820 --> 19:47.860
Is Her Majesty

19:47.860 --> 19:50.560
selfish?

19:50.740 --> 19:52.530
Take him away.

19:58.010 --> 20:03.290
The traitor will endanger our country! Your Majesty, think twice!

20:03.770 --> 20:08.680
The traitor will endanger our country! Your Majesty, think twice!

20:09.380 --> 20:14.720
The traitor will endanger our country! Your Majesty, think twice!

20:14.740 --> 20:17.600
The traitor will endanger our country!

20:28.130 --> 20:31.320
Mr. Fan, when will you leave?

20:31.580 --> 20:34.480
Your Majesty, I'll leave tomorrow.

20:34.580 --> 20:36.110
After parting this time,

20:36.130 --> 20:38.440
I wonder when we can meet again.

20:41.050 --> 20:42.340
Mr. Fan, you should

20:42.340 --> 20:44.080
spend more time writing your book.

20:44.100 --> 20:46.930
I'm still waiting for the following chapters.

20:49.620 --> 20:52.440
Yes, Your Majesty.

20:54.340 --> 20:56.250
Making a man like Shen Zhong

20:56.250 --> 20:57.580
lose all his authority

20:57.580 --> 20:58.740
in such a short time,

20:58.740 --> 21:00.600
Your Excellency, you're really amazing!

21:01.220 --> 21:02.600
However,

21:02.700 --> 21:04.890
he's still the Commander-in-Chief.

21:05.250 --> 21:06.440
He won't hold the position for long.

21:06.460 --> 21:07.680
Others will take over his power when he falls into disgrace.

21:07.700 --> 21:09.360
It's only a matter of time.

21:09.380 --> 21:11.230
It's a bit too fast.

21:11.250 --> 21:13.510
Your Excellency, what's your concern?

21:13.530 --> 21:15.560
Though we've taken down Shen Zhong,

21:15.580 --> 21:16.650
we still haven't got

21:16.650 --> 21:17.860
the name of

21:17.860 --> 21:19.840
the smuggler.

21:20.930 --> 21:22.290
Your Excellency!

21:22.620 --> 21:24.500
Your Excellency, Shangshan Hu is here.

21:24.500 --> 21:25.720
He wants to see you.

21:45.010 --> 21:46.890
Where's the body of my adoptive father?

21:47.460 --> 21:49.290
There's a cave on the cliff.

21:49.860 --> 21:51.030
Was he buried inside?

21:51.050 --> 21:52.320
I didn't bury him under the ground.

21:54.500 --> 21:56.050
He said in his last wish that

21:56.410 --> 21:57.530
after being locked up

21:57.530 --> 21:59.110
deep in the dungeon for decades,

21:59.130 --> 22:01.010
he was scared of the darkness under the ground.

22:02.380 --> 22:05.770
He wanted to rest in the light.

22:10.050 --> 22:12.080
Tell me the exact place.

22:12.700 --> 22:14.050
I've written it for you.

22:27.580 --> 22:28.410
I was intended to kill you

22:28.410 --> 22:30.650
before you leave Shangjing.

22:37.820 --> 22:39.870
I'll leave tomorrow.

22:39.890 --> 22:41.410
You'd better hurry.

22:44.100 --> 22:46.560
Given that you've disposed of my adoptive father's body,

22:47.220 --> 22:49.170
I'll spare your life this time.

22:51.050 --> 22:52.480
Fan Xian,

22:54.980 --> 22:57.370
after my mourning period,

22:57.930 --> 23:00.250
I'll go to Nanqing in person

23:00.410 --> 23:02.170
to take your life.

23:03.130 --> 23:04.650
I'll wait for you.

23:15.930 --> 23:17.200
Gao Da.

23:18.770 --> 23:20.050
Your Excellency.

23:21.010 --> 23:22.510
Ask Haitang Duoduo

23:22.530 --> 23:23.840
over.

23:26.700 --> 23:27.960
What's wrong?

23:29.130 --> 23:31.750
Your Excellency, there are many people in the mission.

23:31.770 --> 23:33.390
It's easier for the princess to find out.

23:33.410 --> 23:34.960
Please be cautious.

23:36.620 --> 23:38.440
Hurry up and go!

23:38.530 --> 23:40.440
Stop hanging out with Wang Qinian.

23:40.460 --> 23:41.250
I...

23:41.250 --> 23:42.840
What?

23:55.380 --> 23:56.460
Your Majesty,

23:56.460 --> 23:57.100
I've passed on your order

23:57.100 --> 23:58.440
in advance.

23:58.820 --> 24:00.270
Those who are loyal to you

24:00.290 --> 24:01.800
in different ministries

24:01.820 --> 24:02.700
all know that

24:02.700 --> 24:05.370
we'll deal with Shen Zhong today.

24:05.770 --> 24:08.050
For those who want to help Shen Zhong out of old friendships,

24:08.700 --> 24:10.230
some are controlled

24:10.250 --> 24:11.930
and some are sent away from the capital.

24:13.500 --> 24:14.750
With my followers

24:14.770 --> 24:16.770
and my mother's followers

24:17.700 --> 24:19.410
working together,

24:19.860 --> 24:23.370
Shen Zhong stands no chance.

24:25.650 --> 24:27.960
He Daoren goes to see Fan Xian secretly.

24:31.250 --> 24:33.630
Guo Baokun is the nominal Chief.

24:33.650 --> 24:36.010
He Daoren is the actual future

24:36.010 --> 24:37.770
Chief of secret agents in Shangjing Town.

24:38.460 --> 24:39.250
After I leave,

24:39.250 --> 24:41.080
you should take charge of the intelligence
network in Shangjing Town.

24:41.460 --> 24:43.050
I'll try my best.

24:43.530 --> 24:45.010
Take it easy.

24:45.220 --> 24:46.890
After our smuggling business expands,

24:46.890 --> 24:48.130
we can buy information

24:48.130 --> 24:49.800
openly.

24:49.820 --> 24:51.460
It won't be long

24:51.460 --> 24:52.750
before secret agents can live a safe life.

24:52.770 --> 24:54.290
What else do you want to tell me?

24:54.580 --> 24:55.750
I can't stay long

24:55.770 --> 24:57.990
for fear that I might be discovered.

24:58.010 --> 24:59.230
Nothing else.

24:59.250 --> 25:00.960
No need to see me before I leave.

25:01.220 --> 25:03.600
Protect yourself. Don't be discovered.

25:12.340 --> 25:13.580
Your Majesty, since you've known

25:13.580 --> 25:15.680
He Daoren is a secret agent of Nanqing,

25:15.700 --> 25:17.600
why not catch him?

25:17.820 --> 25:19.360
What can we get

25:19.380 --> 25:21.560
by catching him?

25:25.980 --> 25:28.100
Sometimes, enemies can

25:28.100 --> 25:30.080
do things for us.

25:31.050 --> 25:32.910
Look at the situation now.

25:32.930 --> 25:35.010
Shen Zhong has no future.

25:35.340 --> 25:37.600
Now we don't have to fight him.

25:38.170 --> 25:39.800
So why not use our enemies?

25:39.820 --> 25:40.620
But now,

25:40.620 --> 25:42.600
He Daoren is useless

25:42.620 --> 25:44.600
after defeating Shen Zhong.

25:46.010 --> 25:47.320
No hurry.

25:47.700 --> 25:49.440
By keeping He Daoren,

25:49.650 --> 25:50.840
Nanqing can only

25:50.860 --> 25:51.580
get the information

25:51.580 --> 25:53.600
we want them to get.

25:54.130 --> 25:56.820
Your Majesty, you want to use He Daoren

25:56.820 --> 25:58.480
to sow distrust among our enemies.

26:01.290 --> 26:02.840
But Her Majesty

26:02.930 --> 26:04.840
has got Shangshan Hu.

26:04.890 --> 26:06.770
Mother will never send Shangshan Hu

26:06.770 --> 26:08.440
back to the army.

26:08.700 --> 26:10.150
From now on,

26:10.170 --> 26:12.600
that tiger is useless.

26:15.740 --> 26:17.290
I'm afraid Fan Xian

26:17.460 --> 26:19.560
will become a formidable enemy of Beiqi.

26:21.500 --> 26:24.600
Fan Xian will never be our enemy.

26:24.820 --> 26:26.440
Remember that

26:26.770 --> 26:28.480
the biggest enemy

26:28.500 --> 26:30.600
always comes from within.

26:32.650 --> 26:34.680
Those princes from Nanqing

26:36.890 --> 26:39.130
are all hard to deal with.

26:39.530 --> 26:41.840
Fan Xian still has

26:41.930 --> 26:44.050
a long way to go in future.

26:53.640 --> 27:00.470
=Poetic Genius=

27:08.580 --> 27:09.600
You're leaving.

27:09.620 --> 27:11.680
Why ask me over?

27:12.220 --> 27:13.560
I want to see someone.

27:13.580 --> 27:16.130
Si Lili can't see you for sure.

27:16.170 --> 27:17.600
It's Zhuang Mohan.

27:19.700 --> 27:20.650
Didn't he spit blood

27:20.650 --> 27:21.890
after being pissed by you?

27:21.890 --> 27:23.110
You still can't let him go?

27:23.130 --> 27:25.960
I was entrusted by someone to send him a message.

27:27.050 --> 27:28.480
Why do you ask me for help?

27:28.500 --> 27:30.130
You can see him yourself.

27:30.500 --> 27:31.250
I don't want others

27:31.250 --> 27:32.770
to know about it.

27:34.460 --> 27:36.440
What about me?

27:37.580 --> 27:38.410
I cry, "Can't you see? Can't you see?

27:38.410 --> 27:39.630
The green leaves are fresh but the red flowers are fading!"

27:39.650 --> 27:40.650
You're crabapple blossoms.

27:40.650 --> 27:42.010
You're no mortal.

27:43.290 --> 27:44.460
You're smooth-tongued

27:44.460 --> 27:46.170
when asking for help.

27:47.620 --> 27:48.930
Do me a favor.

27:51.010 --> 27:52.010
I assure you

27:52.010 --> 27:53.480
it won't harm Beiqi.

27:53.500 --> 27:55.080
Nor will I scold him.

28:34.530 --> 28:35.740
Master Zhuang.

28:35.760 --> 28:38.270
=Zhuang Mohan, Beiqi Litterateur=

28:43.130 --> 28:44.600
No need to stand up.

28:45.130 --> 28:45.770
Fine.

28:45.770 --> 28:47.530
Take a seat! Take a seat! Take a seat!

28:52.130 --> 28:53.530
Look!

28:54.050 --> 28:57.200
The line "One who has seen the ocean
thinks nothing of mere rivers.

28:57.220 --> 28:59.960
One who has appreciated the clouds over the
Wushan Mountain sees nothing of mere clouds."

29:00.740 --> 29:03.770
has beautiful diction and neat antithesis.

29:03.820 --> 29:05.960
But without knowing the context of the latter sentence,

29:06.890 --> 29:10.030
it doesn't make any sense.

29:10.050 --> 29:12.200
It really doesn't make any sense.

29:12.700 --> 29:15.360
Wushan Mountain is a holy mountain in the far south.

29:15.380 --> 29:17.750
This mountain is renowned for its unparalleled cloudscape.

29:17.770 --> 29:19.840
The latter sentence uses its name

29:19.860 --> 29:21.320
to express the loyalty in love.

29:21.340 --> 29:22.960
I see.

29:22.980 --> 29:27.170
I've checked many books,

29:27.650 --> 29:30.410
but I just couldn't find Wushan Mountain.

29:31.340 --> 29:33.680
Luckily, you explained it to me.

29:34.620 --> 29:36.340
Are you annotating the poetry collection?

29:36.340 --> 29:37.650
Yes.

29:38.980 --> 29:40.480
I have another question.

29:40.770 --> 29:41.720
Look!

29:41.740 --> 29:44.560
Prince Chen paid at a banquet in the Palace of Perfection.

29:44.580 --> 29:47.840
Ten thousand coins for a cask of wine,
with many a laugh and quip.

29:47.930 --> 29:49.560
What's the literary quotation?

29:50.050 --> 29:51.720
Prince Chen

29:51.740 --> 29:53.200
is a prince surnamed Cao.

29:53.220 --> 29:54.600
He once held a banquet

29:54.620 --> 29:55.800
in the Palace of Perfection.

29:55.820 --> 29:58.080
A prince surnamed Cao?

29:58.290 --> 29:59.870
In past dynasties,

29:59.890 --> 30:02.650
no one from the imperial families was surnamed Cao.

30:03.890 --> 30:05.290
Master Zhuang,

30:05.700 --> 30:08.360
I told you on the Hall of Prayer for Good Harvest that

30:08.380 --> 30:09.860
all these poems come from

30:09.860 --> 30:11.110
another world.

30:11.130 --> 30:12.320
So these literary quotations certainly

30:12.340 --> 30:14.440
won't be found in historical records.

30:17.580 --> 30:19.320
Then,

30:19.860 --> 30:22.500
it's a fairyland in dream?

30:22.500 --> 30:24.290
It's not a fairyland. It's...

30:24.290 --> 30:24.980
What?

30:24.980 --> 30:26.170
It's the imprint left by

30:26.170 --> 30:27.230
another era.

30:27.250 --> 30:30.840
What? Era?

30:31.500 --> 30:33.650
It is earlier than all history

30:33.820 --> 30:35.770
for hundreds and thousands of years.

30:37.580 --> 30:38.620
It's a splendid

30:38.620 --> 30:40.080
civilization

30:40.380 --> 30:41.010
lost in the

30:41.010 --> 30:42.930
river of time.

30:47.250 --> 30:49.320
I don't get it. I don't get it.

30:49.340 --> 30:50.360
Are you referring to

30:50.380 --> 30:52.110
the ancient times?

30:52.130 --> 30:53.600
It's even earlier than that.

30:53.620 --> 30:55.930
How do you know these?

30:57.220 --> 30:58.650
Since I was born,

30:58.700 --> 30:59.250
these things

30:59.250 --> 31:01.050
have been carved in my mind

31:01.250 --> 31:03.560
as if I've seen them in my dreams.

31:06.380 --> 31:08.960
So it is

31:09.100 --> 31:11.030
a dreamland.

31:11.050 --> 31:12.840
Can I put it this way?

31:12.890 --> 31:14.480
Yes, you can.

31:18.380 --> 31:19.650
Good.

31:20.340 --> 31:23.290
Now I understand why there're so many

31:23.290 --> 31:25.560
unknown literary quotations.

31:26.580 --> 31:29.650
It's not because I'm a poor scholar.

31:30.010 --> 31:32.930
How can I know stuff

31:33.980 --> 31:35.890
of the fairyland?

31:38.250 --> 31:40.290
Don't let it bother you.

31:43.220 --> 31:44.440
Fine.

31:55.130 --> 31:56.650
When you came in just now,

31:56.820 --> 31:59.200
why was there no report?

31:59.860 --> 32:00.620
Actually,

32:00.620 --> 32:02.320
I sneaked in to see you.

32:02.340 --> 32:03.230
Your servant was lured away

32:03.250 --> 32:04.930
by my friend.

32:07.380 --> 32:09.840
Why do you sneak in?

32:10.530 --> 32:11.580
Actually, I know

32:11.580 --> 32:13.320
you are in Shangjing,

32:13.340 --> 32:15.530
and I want to see you very much.

32:15.820 --> 32:17.290
But my servant stops me

32:17.290 --> 32:18.930
from visiting you.

32:19.050 --> 32:21.320
He said my condition would go worse

32:21.890 --> 32:24.290
if I see you.

32:26.050 --> 32:27.800
Master Zhuang, are you sick?

32:28.290 --> 32:30.560
I'm just old.

32:44.530 --> 32:46.530
Don't! Don't! Don't!

32:55.860 --> 32:59.750
Your Excellency, back on the Hall of Prayer for Good Harvest,

32:59.770 --> 33:03.010
I framed you up.

33:03.890 --> 33:05.220
Till today,

33:05.220 --> 33:07.170
I feel guilty all the time.

33:07.530 --> 33:11.010
By seeing you today,

33:11.250 --> 33:14.680
I can finally apologize to you in person.

33:15.010 --> 33:16.680
Your Excellency,

33:17.250 --> 33:20.010
please be magnanimous and forgive me.

33:20.290 --> 33:22.680
Master Zhuang, you don't have to!

33:25.770 --> 33:30.680
When it comes to explaining classic texts
and annotating articles, you win.

33:30.700 --> 33:34.930
But when it comes to reciting poems, I win.

33:35.290 --> 33:37.600
For a literary giant...

33:37.620 --> 33:39.030
Good poems!

33:39.050 --> 33:40.380
...I'm not qualified.

33:40.380 --> 33:41.680
Good!

33:42.930 --> 33:44.800
But for a man,

33:46.220 --> 33:50.530
you're not qualified.

33:57.770 --> 33:59.440
I know you did that

33:59.500 --> 34:01.560
to save Xiao En.

34:04.460 --> 34:05.960
To be honest,

34:07.130 --> 34:09.000
though he is surnamed Xiao,

34:09.730 --> 34:12.450
he's my full brother.

34:14.770 --> 34:16.840
Actually, Master Zhuang, I visit you this time

34:17.940 --> 34:20.130
because Senior Xiao asked me to.

34:24.820 --> 34:26.240
Really?

34:29.010 --> 34:32.930
He finally wants to contact me.

34:33.530 --> 34:35.730
Did he ask you

34:36.730 --> 34:38.650
to tell me anything?

34:45.580 --> 34:47.040
What's wrong?

34:49.580 --> 34:51.450
Is he dead?

34:56.620 --> 34:58.520
Before going back,

34:58.900 --> 35:03.320
you should visit Zhuang Mohan when you're free.

35:04.140 --> 35:06.240
Inform him of my death.

35:07.140 --> 35:08.690
I will.

35:09.730 --> 35:11.430
Tell me.

35:11.450 --> 35:14.240
Will I see them after I die?

35:45.050 --> 35:49.280
Man dies.

35:50.860 --> 35:53.930
Senior Xiao died in peace.

35:55.940 --> 35:59.170
He lived a miserable life.

35:59.620 --> 36:01.970
That's because

36:03.660 --> 36:06.000
he killed so many people.

36:07.490 --> 36:09.000
Nowadays, man gets power

36:09.050 --> 36:11.560
by killing others and setting places on fire.

36:12.250 --> 36:13.650
Your Excellency,

36:14.100 --> 36:16.210
you shouldn't be like that.

36:17.100 --> 36:19.600
Man like you who's capable of writing wonderful poems

36:20.420 --> 36:23.240
shouldn't be defiled by the secular world.

36:23.900 --> 36:25.140
I can't bear to see

36:25.140 --> 36:28.170
these excellent poems covered by dust.

36:34.450 --> 36:36.170
Master Zhuang, I promise you.

36:37.530 --> 36:39.410
I'll never be like that.

36:42.490 --> 36:43.730
Good!

36:44.140 --> 36:45.370
Good!

36:59.970 --> 37:01.320
It's late.

37:02.140 --> 37:04.240
I'm leaving.

37:07.690 --> 37:09.760
When will you leave Shangjing?

37:09.900 --> 37:11.280
We'll leave tomorrow.

37:12.530 --> 37:14.080
Tomorrow?

37:17.690 --> 37:20.860
Then this must be

37:20.860 --> 37:22.760
our last time to meet.

37:30.250 --> 37:31.930
In my lifetime,

37:35.450 --> 37:37.320
I've annotated numerous books

37:38.380 --> 37:40.930
and written many articles.

37:41.530 --> 37:43.120
But my experience is

37:43.140 --> 37:45.080
what I feel most proud of.

38:34.450 --> 38:36.650
Isn't that Commander Shen?

38:37.180 --> 38:38.600
Her Majesty ordered you

38:38.620 --> 38:41.080
to rest at home for a few days.

38:41.580 --> 38:43.660
But our Division can't operate

38:43.660 --> 38:46.040
without a leader.

38:46.140 --> 38:47.430
There's no other way.

38:47.450 --> 38:48.730
From tomorrow on,

38:48.730 --> 38:51.670
I'll take your position temporarily.

38:51.690 --> 38:54.560
Feel relieved to rest at home.

38:54.580 --> 38:55.730
Just leave

38:55.730 --> 38:56.970
all the trouble

38:56.970 --> 38:58.730
to me.

39:10.730 --> 39:12.040
Your Excellency,

39:12.770 --> 39:14.600
why are you still here?

39:14.620 --> 39:16.080
Seriously speaking,

39:16.100 --> 39:18.080
you're defying the imperial order.

39:18.100 --> 39:19.840
Don't make it hard for me.

39:19.860 --> 39:23.170
Shall I walk you out in person?

39:32.340 --> 39:33.970
Your Excellency,

39:34.340 --> 39:35.750
powerful and influential as you are,

39:35.770 --> 39:37.730
why do you insist on staying here?

39:38.180 --> 39:41.650
Should I find someone to help you?

39:50.290 --> 39:51.320
Who are you?

39:51.340 --> 39:53.210
How dare you break into the Division?

40:00.970 --> 40:02.840
Your Excellency, are these

40:03.770 --> 40:05.320
all your men?

40:19.290 --> 40:22.270
What we're going to do today is simple.

40:22.290 --> 40:24.520
Stop and kill the Nanqing mission.

40:25.380 --> 40:26.890
There's no imperial edict.

40:27.490 --> 40:29.560
It's my own decision.

40:31.900 --> 40:34.240
As long as we kill every member of the Nanqing mission,

40:34.820 --> 40:36.510
the business deal

40:36.530 --> 40:38.840
will become null automatically.

40:41.580 --> 40:43.130
Everyone,

40:43.490 --> 40:46.840
succeed or not,

40:47.010 --> 40:49.490
this operation will cost your lives.

40:50.970 --> 40:53.000
I'm also afraid to die.

40:54.940 --> 40:59.040
But on second thought,

41:00.940 --> 41:03.890
if I can save Beiqi by sacrificing my life,

41:04.530 --> 41:07.890
it's totally worth it.

41:10.100 --> 41:13.030
With me or not, it's up to you.

41:13.050 --> 41:14.370
I won't force you.

41:16.660 --> 41:18.040
Commander Shen,

41:18.730 --> 41:20.560
you should think is through.

41:20.660 --> 41:22.000
Guards!

41:34.250 --> 41:35.450
You traitors,

41:35.450 --> 41:36.490
how dare you

41:36.490 --> 41:37.840
do this?

41:37.860 --> 41:39.030
Whoever leaves

41:39.050 --> 41:40.370
will be killed!

41:43.180 --> 41:44.100
Do you know

41:44.100 --> 41:45.710
that will cost your lives?

41:45.730 --> 41:47.160
You!

41:47.180 --> 41:48.080
Come back!

41:48.100 --> 41:49.160
Come...

41:49.180 --> 41:50.320
Come on!

41:50.340 --> 41:51.650
Take them!

41:54.340 --> 41:55.930
Come on!

41:57.620 --> 41:58.320
Come on!

41:58.320 --> 42:03.270
=Shangjing Town=

42:22.730 --> 42:23.840
Your Excellency, do you trust

42:23.860 --> 42:25.800
Guo Baokun to stay in Shangjing?

42:26.660 --> 42:27.800
You're right.

42:27.820 --> 42:29.270
What about leaving you behind?

42:29.290 --> 42:31.240
Guo Baokun can definitely complete the task!

42:48.010 --> 42:49.250
They can leave now?

42:49.250 --> 42:51.370
It's too easy for them.

43:11.770 --> 43:13.320
Your Excellency.

43:14.290 --> 43:15.840
She's here.

43:23.770 --> 43:26.170
See me off with a load of things?

43:30.180 --> 43:31.760
Master Zhuang has passed away.

43:32.900 --> 43:34.130
What?

43:58.560 --> 44:02.140
In the river of history,

44:02.160 --> 44:05.630
time goes round and round.

44:08.440 --> 44:11.780
Memories about the former and present lives

44:11.800 --> 44:15.870
join each other in an endless way.

44:17.760 --> 44:20.380
In the long drunken Milky Way,

44:20.400 --> 44:22.640
one season follows another in a flash,

44:22.640 --> 44:25.140
and the wild geese are flying south.

44:25.160 --> 44:26.760
I just can't give up

44:26.760 --> 44:30.100
to be with you for my whole life.

44:30.120 --> 44:35.590
I have been hovering in the dreams
for hundreds and thousands of times.

44:36.840 --> 44:39.390
I can't even say a word when I watch the flowers falling.

44:39.680 --> 44:41.720
Year after year in the wandering,

44:41.720 --> 44:44.380
I count the remaining years.

44:44.400 --> 44:46.580
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:46.600 --> 44:48.590
even though we have ended up the destiny,

44:48.880 --> 44:51.270
I never feel regretful.

44:51.320 --> 44:52.680
In such a chaotic world,

44:52.680 --> 44:55.660
I still miss you as ever.

44:55.680 --> 44:58.630
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:58.920 --> 45:00.980
With a gentle heart,

45:01.000 --> 45:03.660
I cherish our remaining years.

45:03.680 --> 45:05.200
Even though we have to go through

45:05.200 --> 45:07.710
all the hardships along the journey,

45:07.840 --> 45:15.030
you always stay by my side,

45:15.120 --> 45:17.790
watching the falling flowers, speechlessly.

45:18.080 --> 45:20.160
Year after year in the wandering,

45:20.160 --> 45:22.820
I count the remaining years.

45:22.840 --> 45:24.980
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

45:25.000 --> 45:27.230
even though we end up the destiny,

45:27.440 --> 45:29.620
I never feel regretful.

45:29.640 --> 45:31.040
In such a chaotic world,

45:31.040 --> 45:34.100
I still miss you as ever.

45:34.120 --> 45:37.230
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

45:37.320 --> 45:39.460
With a gentle heart,

45:39.480 --> 45:42.180
I cherish our remaining years.

45:42.200 --> 45:43.640
Even though we have to go through

45:43.640 --> 45:46.300
all the hardships along the journey,

45:46.320 --> 45:55.080
you always stay by my side...
